    <!-- ==========================================================================
       DETAILS GRID
       ========================================================================== -->
    <section class="details-body-section">
        <div class="container details-grid">

            <!-- Main Content (Left) -->
            <div class="details-main-content">
                <h2>Atlanta Concerts, Sports & Nights Out</h2>
                <p>Heading to Mercedes-Benz Stadium for a Falcons game, State Farm Arena for a concert, or Truist Park for a Braves game? Traffic congestion, stadium parking delays, and navigating crowded pedestrian zones can quickly put a damper on your evening. Posh Limousines of Atlanta provides the ultimate hassle-free alternative. We handle the logistics, dropping you off directly near the main entrance gates and coordinating a seamless, designated pick-up immediately after the event ends.</p>

                <p>Our hourly charter service is also perfect for dining at Buckhead's finest restaurants, celebrating birthdays in Midtown, or planning a custom brewery and winery route. Your vehicle remains dedicated exclusively to your group for the duration of the reservation.</p>

                <div class="features-list">
                    <h3>What's Included in This Service</h3>
                    <ul class="features-grid-list">
                        <li>
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg>
                            <span>Dedicated, gate-side entrance drop-offs</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg>
                            <span>Unlimited stops within booking timeframes</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg>
                            <span>Bluetooth sync for custom music control</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg>
                            <span>Premium surround sound audio setup</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg>
                            <span>Ice chest & beverage glassware standard</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg>
                            <span>Reliable post-event extraction service</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <h3>Night Out Custom Itineraries</h3>
                <p>Plan your evening without worrying about driving, parking, or coordinating multiple rides. Your professional chauffeur will remain nearby, keeping in constant contact via text, ready to pick you up the minute you are ready to transition to your next venue. With space for up to seven guests, our black SUVs are perfect for small groups looking for a safe, elite experience.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Sidebar (Right) -->
            <aside class="details-sidebar">
                <div class="pricing-box">
                    <span>Starting Price</span>
                    <div class="price-amount">$120/hr</div>
                    <p class="price-details">Hourly rate, garage-to-garage timing</p>
                </div>

                <ul class="sidebar-features">
                    <li>
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg>
                        <span>Late-model Cadillac/Lincoln SUV</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg>
                        <span>Bottled water and ice included</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg>
                        <span>Commercially licensed & insured</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <a href="index.html#contact" class="btn" style="width: 100%; display: block;" onclick="openCalendly('casual')">Book This Service</a>
            </aside>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==========================================================================
       FAQ SECTION
       ========================================================================== -->
    <section class="faq-section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="faq-header">
                <span>Common Questions</span>
                <h2>Casual Events FAQs</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-list">
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
                        Do you provide transportation to Atlanta sporting events?
                        <svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5z"/></svg>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Yes. We provide premium black SUV transportation to and from Atlanta's major sporting venues, including Mercedes-Benz Stadium (Falcons, Atlanta United), State Farm Arena (Hawks), Truist Park (Braves), and Piedmont Park events. Skip the parking nightmare and arrive in style.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
                        Can you take a group out for a night in Midtown or Buckhead?
                        <svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5z"/></svg>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Absolutely. Our black SUVs seat up to 7 passengers, making them ideal for group nights out in Midtown, Buckhead, or Downtown Atlanta. We handle all the routing between venues so your group can focus on the evening without worrying about parking or rideshare wait times.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
                        What is the hourly rate for casual event transportation?
                        <svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5z"/></svg>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Casual event transportation starts at $120 per hour with a minimum booking window. This covers multi-stop evenings, concert runs, and event transportation within the Metro Atlanta area. Contact us for a full quote based on your itinerary.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
                        Do you do concert pickups and drop-offs in Atlanta?
                        <svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5z"/></svg>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Yes. We handle concert transportation to all major Atlanta venues including State Farm Arena, Ameris Bank Amphitheatre, and Coca-Cola Roxy. Our chauffeur will coordinate a pickup time post-show and meet you at a designated exit point to avoid the crowd rush.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
                        Can I make multiple stops during a casual event booking?
                        <svg class="faq-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5z"/></svg>
                    </button>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Yes. Our hourly casual event service is designed for multi-stop evenings. Whether you are hitting two or three venues across Atlanta or doing a restaurant-to-event run, your chauffeur stays with your group for the full booking window and handles all routing between stops.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

